10:T9c9,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』悲伝 結いの目の不如帰","description":"西暦2205年。絶え間ない出陣によって刀剣男士たちが疲弊の色を深める中、彼らに下されたのは永禄八年「永禄の変」への出陣。室町幕府第十三代将軍・足利義輝の最期という歴史の転換点の裏で、山姥切国広は学習し成長し続ける《正体不明の敵》鵺と遭遇する。「ぼくは……よしてるさまを……しなせやしない……」と、歴史を改変してでも主を救おうと足掻く鵺の悲しき咆哮。一方、三日月宗近は歴史の守護者として、そして独りで「円環」を背負い続ける者として、あるまじき独断専行を見せ始める。三日月が隠し続けてきた真実と、彼を見つめ続けた山姥切国広の宿命が火花を散らす、シリーズ最大級の衝撃作。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-hiden","keywords":"刺さる/しんどい, 世界観つよめ, 殺陣厚め, 群像のうまみ","about":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"鈴木 拡樹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/suzuki-hiroki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"三津谷 亮","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/mitsuya-ryo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"椎名 鯛造","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/shiina-taizo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"和田 雅成","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/wada-masanari"},{"@type":"Person","name":"和田 琢磨","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/wada-takuma"},{"@type":"Person","name":"健人","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kento"},{"@type":"Person","name":"東 啓介","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/higashi-keisuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"川上 将大","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kawakami-shota"},{"@type":"Person","name":"前山 剛久","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/maeyama-takahisa"},{"@type":"Person","name":"加藤 将","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kato-sho"},{"@type":"Person","name":"玉城 裕規","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/tamaki-yuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"中河内 雅貴","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/nakagauchi-masataka"},{"@type":"Person","name":"碓井 将大","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/usui-masahiro"}]}5:["$","main",null,{"className":"container","style":{"paddingBlock":32},"children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$10"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"stack-lg","children":[["$","section",null,{"class